y-3__dt" style="background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-main) 50%, #000)"><div class="lw-company-3__dt_text" data-lw_font_set="Murecho" style="font-weight:600;line-height:1.7">建設業許可</div><div class="lw-company-3__dt_arrow" style="background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-main) 50%, #000)"></div></dt><dd class="lw-company-3__dd" data-lw_font_set="" style="border-color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-main) 50%, #000);line-height:1.7">〇〇県知事許可（般-〇）第00000号</dd></div><div class="lw-company-3__row dt_width_m sp_clm_1"><dt class="lw-company-3__dt" style="background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-main) 50%, #000)"><div class="lw-company-3__dt_text" data-lw_font_set="Murecho" style="font-weight:600;line-height:1.7">加入保険</div><div class="lw-company-3__dt_arrow" style="background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-main) 50%, #000)"></div></dt><dd class="lw-company-3__dd" data-lw_font_set="" style="border-color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-main) 50%, #000);line-height:1.7">請負業者賠償責任保険／建設工事保険／リフォーム瑕疵保険（登録事業者）</dd></div></dl></div>
